From d9ed11ed62f4fbdc86f7407d47a3d31bb4f983dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 4 Jun 2026 06:18:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: migrate email to Resend, fix duplicate contact submit,
 fix checkout stale closure, fix broken package.json
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Replace nodemailer/SMTP with Resend in email.ts and emailNotifier.ts
  - Contact form, Parts ID, and order notification emails now use RESEND_API_KEY
  - Removed EMAIL_APP_PASSWORD / self-hosted SMTP dependency
- Set default forward email to info@allwindowdoorparts.com (was stale dev addresses)
- Fix contact.tsx: remove duplicate raw fetch('/api/contact') — useSubmitContact
  already calls POST /api/contact; the extra fetch was sending every email twice
- Fix checkout.tsx: replace useState orderData with useRef to eliminate stale-closure
  bug where onApprove read null from React state before re-render completed,
  causing 'Order information missing' errors on valid PayPal approvals
- Fix root package.json: malformed JSON (embedded second object inside pnpm.overrides
  block was breaking pnpm install)
